  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add olive oil and saute the chopped onion until translucent.",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add ground cumin, coriander, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir for 1 minute.",
    "Place a tortilla in the skillet and sprinkle shredded cheese on half of the tortilla.",
    "Fold the tortilla in half to enclose the cheese.",
    "Cook for 2-3 minutes until the tortilla is crispy and the cheese is melted.",
    "Flip the quesadilla and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes until crispy and golden.",
    "Repeat with remaining tortillas and cheese.",
    "Cut into wedges and serve hot."
